---
title: "mint - Supply Asset to Lending Pool (Scallop Lend)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_version: check version == current_version
    q_check_version --> q_error_version: version mismatch
    q_error_version --> [*]: abort 73729
    q_check_version --> q_check_active: version matches
    q_check_active --> q_error_inactive: market not active
    q_error_inactive --> [*]: abort 73729
    q_check_active --> q_check_cap: market active
    q_check_cap --> q_error_cap: supply >= supply_cap
    q_error_cap --> [*]: abort 81922
    q_check_cap --> q_accrue_interest: supply < supply_cap
    q_accrue_interest --> q_calc_rate: accrue_interest(market, clock)
    q_calc_rate --> q_calc_mint: exchange_rate = total_supply / total_market_coin
    q_calc_mint --> q_mint_scoin: mint_amount = coin_value / exchange_rate
    q_mint_scoin --> q_update_pool: deposit coin into reserve pool
    q_update_pool --> q_emit: total_supply += coin_value
    q_emit --> [*]: emit MintEvent, return Coin of MarketCoin

    note right of q_calc_rate
        INV-001: exchange_rate >= 1.0 (monotonically non-decreasing)
        INV-002: total_supply = sum of all deposited underlying assets + accrued interest
    end note

    note right of q_mint_scoin
        INV-003: mint_amount > 0 when coin_value > 0
        INV-004: MarketCoin total = sum of all minted sCoins
    end note
